{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1222703001:1":{"text":"何かお探しですか？手伝えることはありますか？","source_cn":"你在找什么呀？需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ABB28B04A41DA86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222703002:1":{"text":"えっ、本当に！こんな辺鄙な場所で、あなた方のような親切な人たちに出会えるなんて！","source_cn":"噢，太好了！没想到这么偏僻的地界还能遇到好心人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBDB0CEA5AE6BF30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222703003:1":{"text":"このカバンも寿命かな。見てくださいよこの穴。知らない間に金貨がこぼれたみたいで、今探してるんです。","source_cn":"你们瞧瞧，我这包背了太久，一不注意竟然破了个洞，包里的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84CFCA212DE82E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222703004:1":{"text":"はぁ、半年かけて貯めた金貨が……もし見つからなかったら、<style=\"highlight\">ゴールドグッピー</style>が釣れない！","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222703004":{"text":"はぁ、半年かけて貯めた金貨が……もし見つからなかったら、<style=\"highlight\">ゴールドグッピー</style>が釣れない！","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天铁定钓不上<style=highlight>黄金孔雀</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","